              ],
              "content": "Fig. 11.21: Observing images in two mirrors"
            }
          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_15_image_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.282,
            0.409,
            0.857,
            0.466
          ],
          "content": "You are given a small piece of a plane mirror. Can this piece form an image of an object much larger than the mirror, like a large tree? Think and predict. Then carry out the activity."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
