          "level": 2,
          "content": "FASCINATING FACTS"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.271,
            0.534,
            0.858,
            0.587
          ],
          "content": "Light emitted by the Sun takes about 8 minutes and 20 seconds to reach the Earth. Hence, if the Sun were to suddenly stop emitting light, we would not know that for another 8 minutes 20 seconds."
